TYPES.md §2 (`Kind` is not writable), DECISIONS 340: a variant's kind cannot be named as a type, so no @text fn's result, which is always written, holds one and Decode<Fn>File never meets it: `Shape.kind` reads as a case named kind.
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// A shape.
variant Shape @json(tag: "kind") {
  /// A box.
  box
}

/// Kinds.
@text("kinds.json")
export fn kinds() -> [Shape.kind] { return [] }

emit go { out: "@sovcommon/a", mode: types }
emit text { out: "out/a" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E3003]  a/a.canon:12:29
  a.Shape has no case kind

